x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

### Record Audit Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/audit/event
x-actor-id: {{actorId}}
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "au-test-001",
  "actorId": "rev-asha",
  "action": "finding.viewed",
  "targetType": "finding",
  "targetId": "find-001",
  "detail": "Viewed finding in testing"
}

