GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendation/u-karthik/e-drive-admin
x-actor-id: {{actorId}}
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

### F03: Get Coverage Guard
GET {{baseUrl}}/coverage-guard/u-karthik/e-drive-admin
x-actor-id: {{actorId}}
x-session-id: {{sessionId}}

